SUMMARY:Juneteenth Celebration
DESCRIPTION:On June 19\, 1865\, two years after President Abraham Lincoln issued the Emancipation Proclamation\, enslaved people in Texas finally received word: They were free. \nJoin LancasterHistory and the Lancaster Branch of the NAACP for a gathering and celebration of the Juneteenth holiday. \nMore information to come!
URL:https://stevensandsmithcenter.org/event/juneteenth-celebration/
